eens\n5024-\n5025-A set of running tweens (the engine keeps one per game: `ctx.tweens`).\n5026-\n5027-- `get count: number`: Tweens still running.\n5028-- `to(target: T, to: Partial<Record<keyof T, number>>, options: TweenOptions = {}): Tween`: Glide `target`'s numeric properties to `to`. A new tween on the same target and property takes over (the old one stops where it is).\n5029-- `value(from: number, to: number, options: TweenOptions, apply: (v: number) => void): Tween`: Tween a plain number from `from` to `to`, calling `apply(v)` every frame.\n5030-- `call(seconds: number, fn: () => void): Tween`: Call `fn` after `seconds` of game time.\n5031-- `cancel(target?: object): void`: Stop every tween on `target` (or everything).\n5032-- `clear(): void`: Stop everything (level unload). Pending `done` promises resolve.\n5033-- `update(dt: number): void`\n5034-\n5035-### interface View\n5036-\n5037-- `readonly container: HTMLElement | null`: The page element the canvas sits in; null headless.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"597d3a1c-db2a-4749-a8fd-5a8ff36f0d78","uuid":"2727a64d-96ae-4b8c-9c3f-71a001296440","timestamp":"2026-11-05T15:41:04.781Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"3185:### type ModelPart\n3186-\n3187-```ts\n3188-type ModelPart = Prim | GroupPart | MirrorPart | UsePart\n3189-```\n3190-\n3191-### interface ModelProvenance\n3192-\n3193-Where an imported or traced model came from (a check fails without it).\n3194-\n3195-- `readonly url: string`\n3196-- `readonly licence: string`\n3197-- `readonly pack?: string`\n3198-- `readonly file?: string`\n3199-- `readonly author?: string`\n3200-- `readonly sha256?: string`\n3201-- `readonly tool?: string`\n3202-- `readonly colours?: Readonly<Record<Slot, string>>`: Source sRGB per slot, for re-mapping later.\n3203-- `readonly fidelity?: Fidelity`\n3204-\n3205-### modelSheet()\n3206-\n3207-```ts\n3208-function modelSheet(idOrDef: string | ModelDef, opts: ModelSheetOptions = {}): ModelSheet\n3209-```\