dt` seconds of game time (times `speed`) while playing, firing the cues passed.\n- `seek(t: number): void`: Move the playhead to `t` without firing the cues in between (scrubbing). Cues before `t` count as done and cues after it will fire again (going back re-arms them). Ignored while skipping (a cue that loops back cannot undo a skip).\n- `skip(): void`: Jump to the end: the cues not yet fired run (except the cosmetic ones), then `onEnd`. Cues after `duration` never fire, played or skipped.\n- `camera(t = this.time): CameraShot | null`: Where the camera is at `t` (default now): on each key at its time, gliding between keys on a smooth curve (Catmull-Rom tangents, so the speed has no jolt at a key; the first and last key of each shot ease in and out). A `cut` key starts a new shot. Null witho…\n- `line(t = this.time): Line | null`: The subtitle showing at `t` (default now), or null.\n- `bars(t = this.time): number`: How far the letterbox bars are in (0..1) at `t` (default now): sliding in at the start, out at the end.\n\n### interface TimelineLine\n\n5023:### class Tweens\n5024-\n5025-A set of running tweens (the engine keeps one per game: `ctx.tweens`).\n5026-\n5027-- `get count: number`: Tweens still running.\n5028-- `to(target: T, to: Partial<Record<keyof T, number>>, options: TweenOptions = {}): Tween`: Glide `target`'s numeric properties to `to`. A new tween on the same target and property takes over (the old one stops where it is).\n5029-- `value(from: number, to: number, options: TweenOptions, apply: (v: number) => void): Tween`: Tween a plain number from `from` to `to`, calling `apply(v)` every frame.\n5030-- `call(seconds: number, fn: () => void): Tween`: Call `fn` after `seconds` of game time.\n5031-- `cancel(target?: object): void`: Stop every tween on `target` (or everything).\n5032-- `clear(): void`: Stop everything (level unload). Pending `done` promises resolve.\n5033-- `update(dt: number): void`\n5034-\n5035-### interface View\n5036-\n5037-- `readonly container: HTMLElement | null`: The page element the canvas sits in; null headless.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0143WV9TChjEyXbwtAPKurGs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
