{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk6csiHzyjqqQoRen7Pz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XXqmMUnRQDgmpb9VBzaE5u","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\n# --- Op 6 flow\np='src/content/ops/op6.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  onRewind: [{ spawn: [{ k: 'clot', id: 'clot', at: [-1.4, -0.9], r: 0.5, unlocks: 'uc1' }] }, { lock: 'uc1' }, { say: 'sabine|There. See it now? *Laser* the clot. Then again.' }, { composure: 0 }],\"\"\",\"\"\"  // The first Second Look after the burst shows the clot that was there all along.\n  onRewind: [{ ifPersist: 'burstSeen', then: [{ ifPersist: 'clotShown', then: [], else: [{ persist: 'clotShown' }, { spawn: [{ k: 'clot', id: 'clot', at: [-1.4, -0.9], r: 0.5, unlocks: 'uc1' }] }, { lock: 'uc1' }, { say: 'sabine|There. See it now? *Laser* the clot. Then again.' }] }], else: [] }],\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"spawn: [{ k: 'incision', at: [-3, -2.6], ang: 2, len: 6 }], until: { clear: ['incision'] } },\n    { id: 'clamps',\"\"\",\"\"\"spawn: [{ k: 'organ', id: 'oldkidney', at: [0, 0.7], dir: -90, pull: 2.8, grabR: 0.8, tearMul: 1.8, organ: 'old', locked: true, task: false, onDone: [{ flag: 'oldOut' }] }, { k: 'incision', at: [-3, -2.6], ang: 2, len: 6 }], until: { clear: ['incision'] } },\n    { id: 'clamps',\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"say: 'reyes|Out it comes. Mind the ureter. She needs that.', spawn: [{ k: 'organ', id: 'oldkidney', at: [0, 0.7], dir: -90, pull: 2.8, grabR: 0.8, tearMul: 1.8, organ: 'old' }], until: { clear: ['organ'] } },\"\"\",\"\"\"say: 'reyes|Out it comes. Mind the ureter. She needs that.', do: [{ unlockEnt: 'oldkidney' }], until: { flag: 'oldOut' } },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"onDone: [{ ifPersist: 'looked', then: [{ flag: 'cleanOpen' }], else: [{ flag: 'clotBurst' }, { fx: 'shake' },\"\"\",\"\"\"onDone: [{ ifPersist: 'burstSeen', then: [{ flag: 'cleanOpen' }], else: [{ persist: 'burstSeen' }, { flag: 'clotBurst' }, { fx: 'shake' },\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- op.js: jump keeps placed things; sweep\np='src/sim/op.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      if (isOpenTask(e) && !e.owner) e.dead = true;\n    }\"\"\",\"\"\"      if (CARRY_KINDS.has(e.k) && e.to && !e.placed) { e.x = e.to[0]; e.z = e.to[1]; e.rot = e.rotTo ?? e.rot; e.placed = true; e.task = false; continue; }\n      if (isOpenTask(e) && !e.owner) e.dead = true;\n    }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"import { GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, gelCell, isOpenTask, makeEnt, POOL_KINDS } from './entities.js';\",\"import { CARRY_KINDS, GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, gelCell, isOpenTask, makeEnt, POOL_KINDS } from './entities.js';\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (c.unlockEnt) { const e = sim.ents.find((o) => o.id === c.unlockEnt && !o.dead); if (e) e.locked = false; }\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (c.unlockEnt) { const e = sim.ents.find((o) => o.id === c.unlockEnt && !o.dead); if (e) { e.locked = false; e.task = true; } }\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- bot: partner flags\np='src/sim/bot.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const wantPrompt = sim.flags.clotBurst && !sim.persist.looked;\",\"const wantPrompt = sim.flags.clotBurst && !sim.persist.clotShown;\")\ns=s.replace(\"function gifts(sim, seat, b, out) {\\n  if (!seat.gift || !sim.giftsUnlocked) return;\",\"function gifts(sim, seat, b, out) {\\n  if (!seat.gift || !sim.giftsUnlocked || b.noGift) return;\")\ns=s.replace(\"const dosing = !b.god && sim.doses > 0\",\"const dosing = !b.god && !b.noDose && sim.doses > 0\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/content/ops/op9.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"partner: { surgeon: 'sabine', gift: 'look', bot: { skill: 0.72 }, region: 'left' },\",\"partner: { surgeon: 'sabine', gift: 'look', bot: { skill: 0.72, noGift: true, noDose: true }, region: 'left' },\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- attract stage index\np='src/stages/attract.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"{ kind: 'op', op: 'op6', stage: 7, seconds: 22, gift: 'look', composure: 100 },\",\"{ kind: 'op', op: 'op6', stage: 6, seconds: 24, gift: 'look', composure: 100 },\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- title any input\np='src/stages/title.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (d.nav.confirm || d.click || d.nav.start || d.pads.some((p) => p.edge[0])) {\",\"if (d.anyPress) {\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- log flag + briefing\np='src/stages/briefing.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"App.goto(new OperationStage({ opId: this.o.opId, mode: this.o.mode, difficulty: this.o.difficulty, seats: this.o.seats, startStage: this.o.startStage }),\",\"App.goto(new OperationStage({ opId: this.o.opId, mode: this.o.mode, difficulty: this.o.difficulty, seats: this.o.seats, startStage: this.o.startStage, fromLog: this.o.mode === 'replay' }),\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- operation: crisis rigs, tag swap, results flag, net wheel clicks\np='src/stages/operation.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"new ResultsStage({ sim: this.sim, opId: this.opId, mode: this.mode, seatsCfg: this.o.seats })\",\"new ResultsStage({ sim: this.sim, opId: this.opId, mode: this.mode, seatsCfg: this.o.seats, fromLog: this.o.fromLog })\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        case 'tag': if (this.controls[0]) {\"\"\",\"\"\"        case 'tag': { const r = this.handRigs; if (r[1]) { [r[0], r[1]] = [r[1], r[0]]; } } if (this.controls[0]) {\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.source) this.frameInput(ctx, dt, overlay);\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (this.mode !== 'attract') this.frameInput(ctx, dt, overlay);\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    const nav = App.devices.nav;\n    if (!overlay && !this.ended && nav.start) { this.openPause(); return; }\n    if (overlay) return;\"\"\",\"\"\"    const nav = App.devices.nav;\n    const local = this.source ? [this.source.control].filter(Boolean) : this.controls;\n    if (!this.source && !overlay && !this.ended && nav.start) { this.openPause(); return; }\n    if (overlay) return;\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"          const c = this.controls[b.seat];\n          if (c && this.state.tools.includes(b.tool)) { c.lastTool = c.tool; c.tool = b.tool; App.sfx('click'); }\"\"\",\"\"\"          const c = this.source ? this.source.control : this.controls[b.seat];\n          if (c && (this.source ? b.seat === c.seatId : true) && this.state.tools.includes(b.tool)) { c.lastTool = c.tool; c.tool = b.tool; App.sfx('click'); }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    for (const c of this.controls) {\n      if (!c) continue;\n      if (c.reminder) { c.reminder = false; this.hud.reminderT = 3; App.sfx('uiMove'); }\n    }\"\"\",\"\"\"    for (const c of local) {\n      if (!c) continue;\n      if (c.reminder) { c.reminder = false; this.hud.reminderT = 3; App.sfx('uiMove'); }\n    }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    // The ghost hand: The Second Look's replay and Miserere's copy.\n    this.updateGhost(ctx, dt);\"\"\",\"\"\"    this.updateCrisisHands(ctx, dt, tv);\n    // The ghost hand: The Second Look's replay and Miserere's copy.\n    this.updateGhost(ctx, dt);\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  showCursor() { return App.overlays.length > 0 && App.devices.last === 'kbm'; }\n\"\"\",\"\"\"  showCursor() { return App.overlays.length > 0 && App.devices.last === 'kbm'; }\n\n  /** Paddles come up for a Code Blue; two gloves press for the massage. */\n  updateCrisisHands(ctx, dt, tv) {\n    const st = this.state;\n    const crisis = st.codeBlue ? 'paddle' : st.massage ? 'massage' : null;\n    if (crisis && !this.crisisRigs) this.crisisRigs = [new HandRig(ctx, 0, { gloves: SEAT_GLOVES[0] }), new HandRig(ctx, 1, { gloves: SEAT_GLOVES[0] })];\n    if (!this.crisisRigs) return;\n    const on = !!crisis;\n    this.crisisRigs.forEach((r, i) => {\n      r.group.visible = on;\n      if (!on) return;\n      const side = i === 0 ? 1 : -1;\n      let press = 0;\n      if (crisis === 'massage') press = (st.massage.next === 'a') === (i === 0) ? 0.12 : (this.pressT ?? 0) > 0 ? -0.2 : 0.05;\n      else if (st.codeBlue.charging) press = 0.08 + Math.sin(this.viewT * 30) * 0.02 * st.codeBlue.charge;\n      else press = 0.7;\n      const x = side * (crisis === 'massage' ? 0.85 : 1.6), z = crisis === 'massage' ? 0.2 : side * 0.5;\n      const y = tv.heightAt(x, z, this.viewS) + press;\n      r.update(dt, tv.offsetX + x, y, z, { tool: crisis === 'paddle' ? 'paddle' : 'none', use: true, hidden: false });\n    });\n  }\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- hands: tolerate no tool (massage)\np='src/view/hands.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    this.bob += dt;\n    const hover =\"\"\",\"\"\"    this.bob += dt;\n    if (name === 'paddle') {\n      const t = this.tools.paddle;\n      const lift2 = 0.05;\n      t.position.set(x, y + lift2, z);\n      t.rotation.set(-0.15, this.seatIndex === 0 ? 0.9 : -0.9, 0);\n      this.hand.position.set(x + (this.seatIndex === 0 ? 0.7 : -0.7), y + 0.72, z + 0.62);\n      this.hand.rotation.set(-0.3, this.seatIndex === 0 ? 0.9 : -0.9, 0);\n      if (this.hidden !== !!s.hidden) { this.hidden = !!s.hidden; this.group.visible = !this.hidden; }\n      this.beam.visible = false;\n      this.holo.visible = false;\n      return;\n    }\n    const hover =\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- story + results narrow framing\np='src/stages/story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      cam.position.set(c.position[0] + sw, c.position[1], c.position[2]);\"\"\",\"\"\"      const narrow = Math.max(1, (16 / 9) / Math.max(0.2, cam.aspect));\n      cam.position.set(c.position[0] + sw, c.position[1], c.position[2] * narrow);\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/stages/results.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    cam.position.set(0.2, 1.75, 5.1);\n    cam.lookAt(0, 1.42, 0);\"\"\",\"\"\"    cam.position.set(0.2, 1.75, 5.1 * Math.max(1, (16 / 9) / Math.max(0.2, cam.aspect)));\n    cam.lookAt(0, 1.42, 0);\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- hud narrow\np='src/ui/ophud.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      this.ekg.draw(ui, 74, 11, st.codeBlue ? 'red' : vitalColor(v));\n      if (st.heart && !st.heart.calm) ui.text(74, 2,\"\"\",\"\"\"      if (w >= 400) this.ekg.draw(ui, 74, 11, st.codeBlue ? 'red' : vitalColor(v));\n      if (st.heart && !st.heart.calm) ui.text(74, w >= 400 ? 2 : 6,\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"if (st.composure >= cost) ui.action(bx - ui.actionWidth('gift') - 3, 9, 'gift');\",\"if (st.composure >= cost && w >= 400) ui.action(bx - ui.actionWidth('gift') - 3, 9, 'gift');\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/AUTHORING.md <<'EOF'\n# Authoring: how to add an op, a scene, a strain or a character\n\nContent is data, so the rest of the game can be built with ordinary tools. Everything under `src/content`\nexcept `models/` imports nothing from the engine. Run `node tests/run.mjs content` after any change: it\nchecks speakers, sets, fonts, line lengths, tokens, songs and placeholders.\n\n## An operation\n\nCopy a file in `src/content/ops/`, add it to `ops/index.js`, and give it a line in `pars.js`\n(`node tests/balance.mjs --pars` calibrates that from the bot). A stage:\n\n```js\n{ id: 'pools', objective: 'DRAIN THE BLOOD: HOLD {use} ON A POOL', say: 'reyes|Drain first.', hint: 'drain',\n  spawn: [{ k: 'pool', id: 'p1', at: [-3, 0.6], r: 1.6 }, { k: 'hook', id: 'h1', at: [-3, 0.9], hiddenBy: 'p1', arc: 0.8, pull: 1.2 }],\n  until: { clear: ['pool'] },\n  timed: [{ at: 10, say: 'pem|Anytime, Doctor.' }],\n  on: { vitalsBelow: { 50: { say: 'reyes|Syringe.', unlock: 'syringe' } } } }\n```\n\n- **Positions:** the playable safe zone is `|x| <= 6`, `z` from -3.6 to 3, and keep out of the bottom-right\n  corner (`x > 5`, `z > 2.4`) where the wheel sits.\n- **Entity kinds:** `pool bleeder nick marker hook prop magnet debris tumor organ unclamp core stalk plate\n  clamp fragment donor incision dressing laceration polyp egg cyst clot eye halo mask`, and `strain:*`.\n  `src/sim/entities.js` says what each one wants and `src/sim/tools.js` what each tool does to it.\n- **`until`:** `clear` (true or a list of kinds), `flag`, `time`, or `all` / `any` of those.\n- **Commands** (in `do`, `after`, `timed`, `on`, `onDone`, `onReveal`): `say spawn remove unlock unlockEnt lock\n  setDrain setVitals vitals composure music flag clearFlag persist ifPersist codeBlue massage prompt fake fx\n  perfuse rand cold doses pain painUp count cue camera finish`.\n- **Lines:** `'who|Text with *highlight* and {use} tokens'`. At most two lines of sixty characters. Only the\n  characters the font has: type `-` and `...`. Tokens are in `src/ui/prompts.js`.\n- Test it at once: `?op=<id>&stage=<n>&bot=0.7` plays it with the bot; Dev Mode's JUMP and Copy Op JSON help too.\n\n## A story scene\n\nAdd it to `src/content/scenes/index.js`:\n\n```js\nep11: { id: 'ep11', title: 'NEW DAY', set: 'ward', music: 'ward', beats: [\n  { cam: 'wide', narr: 'THE WARD, AT DAWN.' },\n  { who: 'reyes', emo: 'stern', say: 'You are late, Doctor.', mark: '!', cue: 'door' },\n] }\n```\n\nEmotions: `neutral stern shock sad smile angry panic blush`. Cues are in `StoryStage.cue`. A beat's `set` changes\nthe room. To place it in the shift, add `{ scene, op }` to `EPISODES` in `src/sim/campaign.js`.\n\n## A strain\n\nWrite `src/sim/strains/<name>.js` with `init(sim, e, api)`, `update(sim, e, dt, api)` and\n`on(sim, e, what, ent, seat, api)`, and register it in `strains/index.js`. Rules: plain data only, randomness\nonly from `api.range` and `api.random`, and spawn your pieces as ordinary entities with `owner: e.id`, because\nthen the tools, the hint marker, aim assist, the bot and the network all understand them. A view for anything\nthat needs one goes in `src/view/entviews.js`. Spawn it from a stage with `{ k: 'strain:<name>', deadFlag: 'x' }`.\n\n## A character\n\n1. A bust in `src/content/models/cast.js` (`bust({...})`, and a skin colour in `src/view/bust.js`), and a figure\n   if they appear in wide shots.\n2. A voice in `VOICES` in `src/audio/voice.js` (`timbre`, `basePitch`, `speed`, `range`).\n3. A name in `SPEAKER_NAMES` in `src/content/lines.js`, and pools there if they bark in surgery.\n4. `node check.mjs --sheets src/content/models/index.js` draws them. Look at the sheets.\n\n## An arena or a set\n\nArenas are in `src/content/arenas.js`: a `height` and a `mask` (pure functions), a five-step `ramp`, and painter\nflags; `src/view/field.js` paints them. Sets are functions in `SETS` in `src/view/sets.js`: geometry plus a lighting\nrecipe (`env`, `light`), generic props through `kenney(...)`, and `wide`, `close` and `spots` for the story stage.\n\n## Numbers\n\nEvery balance number is in `src/core/config.js`. `SLIDERS` puts one in Dev Mode's BALANCE tab, live, with Reset to\nDefaults. `node tests/balance.mjs` prints every op at bot skills 0, 0.4, 0.7 and 1.0.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; node tests/run.mjs sim 2>&1 | tail -6; node check.mjs --headless game.js --keys Enter*2,ArrowDown*2 2>&1 | tail -6","description":"Apply conformance fixes, write authoring doc, run sim and headless checks","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":946,"cache_read_input_tokens":615220,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":946},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"597d3a1c-db2a-4749-a8fd-5a8ff36f0d78","uuid":"03300bdb-63e8-4d54-9474-68a5210fa3c3","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:30:53.425Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk6csJV6pk15buJCBMV6","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01XXqmMUnRQDgmpb9VBzaE5u":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\n# --- Op 6 flow\np='src/content/ops/op6.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  onRewind: [{ spawn: [{ k: 'clot', id: 'clot', at: [-1.4, -0.9], r: 0.5, unlocks: 'uc1' }] }, { lock: 'uc1' }, { say: 'sabine|There. See it now? *Laser* the clot. Then again.' }, { composure: 0 }],\"\"\",\"\"\"  // The first Second Look after the burst shows the clot that was there all along.\n  onRewind: [{ ifPersist: 'burstSeen', then: [{ ifPersist: 'clotShown', then: [], else: [{ persist: 'clotShown' }, { spawn: [{ k: 'clot', id: 'clot', at: [-1.4, -0.9], r: 0.5, unlocks: 'uc1' }] }, { lock: 'uc1' }, { say: 'sabine|There. See it now? *Laser* the clot. Then again.' }] }], else: [] }],\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"spawn: [{ k: 'incision', at: [-3, -2.6], ang: 2, len: 6 }], until: { clear: ['incision'] } },\n    { id: 'clamps',\"\"\",\"\"\"spawn: [{ k: 'organ', id: 'oldkidney', at: [0, 0.7], dir: -90, pull: 2.8, grabR: 0.8, tearMul: 1.8, organ: 'old', locked: true, task: false, onDone: [{ flag: 'oldOut' }] }, { k: 'incision', at: [-3, -2.6], ang: 2, len: 6 }], until: { clear: ['incision'] } },\n    { id: 'clamps',\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"say: 'reyes|Out it comes. Mind the ureter. She needs that.', spawn: [{ k: 'organ', id: 'oldkidney', at: [0, 0.7], dir: -90, pull: 2.8, grabR: 0.8, tearMul: 1.8, organ: 'old' }], until: { clear: ['organ'] } },\"\"\",\"\"\"say: 'reyes|Out it comes. Mind the ureter. She needs that.', do: [{ unlockEnt: 'oldkidney' }], until: { flag: 'oldOut' } },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"onDone: [{ ifPersist: 'looked', then: [{ flag: 'cleanOpen' }], else: [{ flag: 'clotBurst' }, { fx: 'shake' },\"\"\",\"\"\"onDone: [{ ifPersist: 'burstSeen', then: [{ flag: 'cleanOpen' }], else: [{ persist: 'burstSeen' }, { flag: 'clotBurst' }, { fx: 'shake' },\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- op.js: jump keeps placed things; sweep\np='src/sim/op.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      if (isOpenTask(e) && !e.owner) e.dead = true;\n    }\"\"\",\"\"\"      if (CARRY_KINDS.has(e.k) && e.to && !e.placed) { e.x = e.to[0]; e.z = e.to[1]; e.rot = e.rotTo ?? e.rot; e.placed = true; e.task = false; continue; }\n      if (isOpenTask(e) && !e.owner) e.dead = true;\n    }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"import { GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, gelCell, isOpenTask, makeEnt, POOL_KINDS } from './entities.js';\",\"import { CARRY_KINDS, GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, gelCell, isOpenTask, makeEnt, POOL_KINDS } from './entities.js';\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (c.unlockEnt) { const e = sim.ents.find((o) => o.id === c.unlockEnt && !o.dead); if (e) e.locked = false; }\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (c.unlockEnt) { const e = sim.ents.find((o) => o.id === c.unlockEnt && !o.dead); if (e) { e.locked = false; e.task = true; } }\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- bot: partner flags\np='src/sim/bot.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const wantPrompt = sim.flags.clotBurst && !sim.persist.looked;\",\"const wantPrompt = sim.flags.clotBurst && !sim.persist.clotShown;\")\ns=s.replace(\"function gifts(sim, seat, b, out) {\\n  if (!seat.gift || !sim.giftsUnlocked) return;\",\"function gifts(sim, seat, b, out) {\\n  if (!seat.gift || !sim.giftsUnlocked || b.noGift) return;\")\ns=s.replace(\"const dosing = !b.god && sim.doses > 0\",\"const dosing = !b.god && !b.noDose && sim.doses > 0\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/content/ops/op9.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"partner: { surgeon: 'sabine', gift: 'look', bot: { skill: 0.72 }, region: 'left' },\",\"partner: { surgeon: 'sabine', gift: 'look', bot: { skill: 0.72, noGift: true, noDose: true }, region: 'left' },\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- attract stage index\np='src/stages/attract.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"{ kind: 'op', op: 'op6', stage: 7, seconds: 22, gift: 'look', composure: 100 },\",\"{ kind: 'op', op: 'op6', stage: 6, seconds: 24, gift: 'look', composure: 100 },\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- title any input\np='src/stages/title.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (d.nav.confirm || d.click || d.nav.start || d.pads.some((p) => p.edge[0])) {\",\"if (d.anyPress) {\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- log flag + briefing\np='src/stages/briefing.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"App.goto(new OperationStage({ opId: this.o.opId, mode: this.o.mode, difficulty: this.o.difficulty, seats: this.o.seats, startStage: this.o.startStage }),\",\"App.goto(new OperationStage({ opId: this.o.opId, mode: this.o.mode, difficulty: this.o.difficulty, seats: this.o.seats, startStage: this.o.startStage, fromLog: this.o.mode === 'replay' }),\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- operation: crisis rigs, tag swap, results flag, net wheel clicks\np='src/stages/operation.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"new ResultsStage({ sim: this.sim, opId: this.opId, mode: this.mode, seatsCfg: this.o.seats })\",\"new ResultsStage({ sim: this.sim, opId: this.opId, mode: this.mode, seatsCfg: this.o.seats, fromLog: this.o.fromLog })\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        case 'tag': if (this.controls[0]) {\"\"\",\"\"\"        case 'tag': { const r = this.handRigs; if (r[1]) { [r[0], r[1]] = [r[1], r[0]]; } } if (this.controls[0]) {\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.source) this.frameInput(ctx, dt, overlay);\"\"\",\"\"\"    if (this.mode !== 'attract') this.frameInput(ctx, dt, overlay);\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    const nav = App.devices.nav;\n    if (!overlay && !this.ended && nav.start) { this.openPause(); return; }\n    if (overlay) return;\"\"\",\"\"\"    const nav = App.devices.nav;\n    const local = this.source ? [this.source.control].filter(Boolean) : this.controls;\n    if (!this.source && !overlay && !this.ended && nav.start) { this.openPause(); return; }\n    if (overlay) return;\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"          const c = this.controls[b.seat];\n          if (c && this.state.tools.includes(b.tool)) { c.lastTool = c.tool; c.tool = b.tool; App.sfx('click'); }\"\"\",\"\"\"          const c = this.source ? this.source.control : this.controls[b.seat];\n          if (c && (this.source ? b.seat === c.seatId : true) && this.state.tools.includes(b.tool)) { c.lastTool = c.tool; c.tool = b.tool; App.sfx('click'); }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    for (const c of this.controls) {\n      if (!c) continue;\n      if (c.reminder) { c.reminder = false; this.hud.reminderT = 3; App.sfx('uiMove'); }\n    }\"\"\",\"\"\"    for (const c of local) {\n      if (!c) continue;\n      if (c.reminder) { c.reminder = false; this.hud.reminderT = 3; App.sfx('uiMove'); }\n    }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    // The ghost hand: The Second Look's replay and Miserere's copy.\n    this.updateGhost(ctx, dt);\"\"\",\"\"\"    this.updateCrisisHands(ctx, dt, tv);\n    // The ghost hand: The Second Look's replay and Miserere's copy.\n    this.updateGhost(ctx, dt);\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  showCursor() { return App.overlays.length > 0 && App.devices.last === 'kbm'; }\n\"\"\",\"\"\"  showCursor() { return App.overlays.length > 0 && App.devices.last === 'kbm'; }\n\n  /** Paddles come up for a Code Blue; two gloves press for the massage. */\n  updateCrisisHands(ctx, dt, tv) {\n    const st = this.state;\n    const crisis = st.codeBlue ? 'paddle' : st.massage ? 'massage' : null;\n    if (crisis && !this.crisisRigs) this.crisisRigs = [new HandRig(ctx, 0, { gloves: SEAT_GLOVES[0] }), new HandRig(ctx, 1, { gloves: SEAT_GLOVES[0] })];\n    if (!this.crisisRigs) return;\n    const on = !!crisis;\n    this.crisisRigs.forEach((r, i) => {\n      r.group.visible = on;\n      if (!on) return;\n      const side = i === 0 ? 1 : -1;\n      let press = 0;\n      if (crisis === 'massage') press = (st.massage.next === 'a') === (i === 0) ? 0.12 : (this.pressT ?? 0) > 0 ? -0.2 : 0.05;\n      else if (st.codeBlue.charging) press = 0.08 + Math.sin(this.viewT * 30) * 0.02 * st.codeBlue.charge;\n      else press = 0.7;\n      const x = side * (crisis === 'massage' ? 0.85 : 1.6), z = crisis === 'massage' ? 0.2 : side * 0.5;\n      const y = tv.heightAt(x, z, this.viewS) + press;\n      r.update(dt, tv.offsetX + x, y, z, { tool: crisis === 'paddle' ? 'paddle' : 'none', use: true, hidden: false });\n    });\n  }\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- hands: tolerate no tool (massage)\np='src/view/hands.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    this.bob += dt;\n    const hover =\"\"\",\"\"\"    this.bob += dt;\n    if (name === 'paddle') {\n      const t = this.tools.paddle;\n      const lift2 = 0.05;\n      t.position.set(x, y + lift2, z);\n      t.rotation.set(-0.15, this.seatIndex === 0 ? 0.9 : -0.9, 0);\n      this.hand.position.set(x + (this.seatIndex === 0 ? 0.7 : -0.7), y + 0.72, z + 0.62);\n      this.hand.rotation.set(-0.3, this.seatIndex === 0 ? 0.9 : -0.9, 0);\n      if (this.hidden !== !!s.hidden) { this.hidden = !!s.hidden; this.group.visible = !this.hidden; }\n      this.beam.visible = false;\n      this.holo.visible = false;\n      return;\n    }\n    const hover =\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- story + results narrow framing\np='src/stages/story.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      cam.position.set(c.position[0] + sw, c.position[1], c.position[2]);\"\"\",\"\"\"      const narrow = Math.max(1, (16 / 9) / Math.max(0.2, cam.aspect));\n      cam.position.set(c.position[0] + sw, c.position[1], c.position[2] * narrow);\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/stages/results.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    cam.position.set(0.2, 1.75, 5.1);\n    cam.lookAt(0, 1.42, 0);\"\"\",\"\"\"    cam.position.set(0.2, 1.75, 5.1 * Math.max(1, (16 / 9) / Math.max(0.2, cam.aspect)));\n    cam.lookAt(0, 1.42, 0);\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n# --- hud narrow\np='src/ui/ophud.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      this.ekg.draw(ui, 74, 11, st.codeBlue ? 'red' : vitalColor(v));\n      if (st.heart && !st.heart.calm) ui.text(74, 2,\"\"\",\"\"\"      if (w >= 400) this.ekg.draw(ui, 74, 11, st.codeBlue ? 'red' : vitalColor(v));\n      if (st.heart && !st.heart.calm) ui.text(74, w >= 400 ? 2 : 6,\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"if (st.composure >= cost) ui.action(bx - ui.actionWidth('gift') - 3, 9, 'gift');\",\"if (st.composure >= cost && w >= 400) ui.action(bx - ui.actionWidth('gift') - 3, 9, 'gift');\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/AUTHORING.md <<'EOF'\n# Authoring: how to add an op, a scene, a strain or a character\n\nContent is data, so the rest of the game can be built with ordinary tools. Everything under `src/content`\nexcept `models/` imports nothing from the engine. Run `node tests/run.mjs content` after any change: it\nchecks speakers, sets, fonts, line lengths, tokens, songs and placeholders.\n\n## An operation\n\nCopy a file in `src/content/ops/`, add it to `ops/index.js`, and give it a line in `pars.js`\n(`node tests/balance.mjs --pars` calibrates that from the bot). A stage:\n\n```js\n{ id: 'pools', objective: 'DRAIN THE BLOOD: HOLD {use} ON A POOL', say: 'reyes|Drain first.', hint: 'drain',\n  spawn: [{ k: 'pool', id: 'p1', at: [-3, 0.6], r: 1.6 }, { k: 'hook', id: 'h1', at: [-3, 0.9], hiddenBy: 'p1', arc: 0.8, pull: 1.2 }],\n  until: { clear: ['pool'] },\n  timed: [{ at: 10, say: 'pem|Anytime, Doctor.' }],\n  on: { vitalsBelow: { 50: { say: 'reyes|Syringe.', unlock: 'syringe' } } } }\n```\n\n- **Positions:** the playable safe zone is `|x| <= 6`, `z` from -3.6 to 3, and keep out of the bottom-right\n  corner (`x > 5`, `z > 2.4`) where the wheel sits.\n- **Entity kinds:** `pool bleeder nick marker hook prop magnet debris tumor organ unclamp core stalk plate\n  clamp fragment donor incision dressing laceration polyp egg cyst clot eye halo mask`, and `strain:*`.\n  `src/sim/entities.js` says what each one wants and `src/sim/tools.js` what each tool does to it.\n- **`until`:** `clear` (true or a list of kinds), `flag`, `time`, or `all` / `any` of those.\n- **Commands** (in `do`, `after`, `timed`, `on`, `onDone`, `onReveal`): `say spawn remove unlock unlockEnt lock\n  setDrain setVitals vitals composure music flag clearFlag persist ifPersist codeBlue massage prompt fake fx\n  perfuse rand cold doses pain painUp count cue camera finish`.\n- **Lines:** `'who|Text with *highlight* and {use} tokens'`. At most two lines of sixty characters. Only the\n  characters the font has: type `-` and `...`. Tokens are in `src/ui/prompts.js`.\n- Test it at once: `?op=<id>&stage=<n>&bot=0.7` plays it with the bot; Dev Mode's JUMP and Copy Op JSON help too.\n\n## A story scene\n\nAdd it to `src/content/scenes/index.js`:\n\n```js\nep11: { id: 'ep11', title: 'NEW DAY', set: 'ward', music: 'ward', beats: [\n  { cam: 'wide', narr: 'THE WARD, AT DAWN.' },\n  { who: 'reyes', emo: 'stern', say: 'You are late, Doctor.', mark: '!', cue: 'door' },\n] }\n```\n\nEmotions: `neutral stern shock sad smile angry panic blush`. Cues are in `StoryStage.cue`. A beat's `set` changes\nthe room. To place it in the shift, add `{ scene, op }` to `EPISODES` in `src/sim/campaign.js`.\n\n## A strain\n\nWrite `src/sim/strains/<name>.js` with `init(sim, e, api)`, `update(sim, e, dt, api)` and\n`on(sim, e, what, ent, seat, api)`, and register it in `strains/index.js`. Rules: plain data only, randomness\nonly from `api.range` and `api.random`, and spawn your pieces as ordinary entities with `owner: e.id`, because\nthen the tools, the hint marker, aim assist, the bot and the network all understand them. A view for anything\nthat needs one goes in `src/view/entviews.js`. Spawn it from a stage with `{ k: 'strain:<name>', deadFlag: 'x' }`.\n\n## A character\n\n1. A bust in `src/content/models/cast.js` (`bust({...})`, and a skin colour in `src/view/bust.js`), and a figure\n   if they appear in wide shots.\n2. A voice in `VOICES` in `src/audio/voice.js` (`timbre`, `basePitch`, `speed`, `range`).\n3. A name in `SPEAKER_NAMES` in `src/content/lines.js`, and pools there if they bark in surgery.\n4. `node check.mjs --sheets src/content/models/index.js` draws them. Look at the sheets.\n\n## An arena or a set\n\nArenas are in `src/content/arenas.js`: a `height` and a `mask` (pure functions), a five-step `ramp`, and painter\nflags; `src/view/field.js` paints them. Sets are functions in `SETS` in `src/view/sets.js`: geometry plus a lighting\nrecipe (`env`, `light`), generic props through `kenney(...)`, and `wide`, `close` and `spots` for the story stage.\n\n## Numbers\n\nEvery balance number is in `src/core/config.js`. `SLIDERS` puts one in Dev Mode's BALANCE tab, live, with Reset to\nDefaults. `node tests/balance.mjs` prints every op at bot skills 0, 0.4, 0.7 and 1.0.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; node tests/run.mjs sim 2>&1 | tail -6; node check.mjs --headless game.js --keys Enter*2,ArrowDown*2 2>&1 | tail -6","description":"Apply conformance fixes, write authoring doc, run sim and headless checks","timeout":500000}}}
