view.json` in work root.\n\n## Status log\n- [x] Step 1 Skeleton (tools/build.mjs writes dist/game.html + ../<stem>.html; vendor/ has hub files)\n- [x] Step 2-3 Sim core, all tools, bot, all 10 ops + pileup + session fights (src/sim, src/content/ops). Node quick check: node tests/quick.mjs \"\" 1\n- [x] Step 4-5 first pass written: busts, figures, sets, story, briefing, results, title, log, consult, attract, overlays (pause/settings/about/dev/fail)\n- [ ] Step 6 strains view polish (written: src/view/entviews.js), check each arena by screenshot\n- [ ] Step 7 Consult net: src/net/session.js is a STUB, card.js + host/client/codec still to write; harness passes\n- [ ] Step 8 Polish/balance: pars (src/content/ops/pars.js), tests/run.mjs + browser tests, docs/AUTHORING.md, bot skill curve\n- [ ] Step 9 Finish: about.js is a STUB, exit-interview.json, chat reply\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":8,"oldLines":7,"newStart":8,"newLines":8,"lines":[" - [x] Step 1 Skeleton (tools/build.mjs writes dist/game.html + ../<stem>.html; vendor/ has hub files)"," - [x] Step 2-3 Sim core, all tools, bot, all 10 ops + pileup + session fights (src/sim, src/content/ops). Node quick check: node tests/quick.mjs \"\" 1"," - [x] Step 4-5 first pass written: busts, figures, sets, story, briefing, results, title, log, consult, attract, overlays (pause/settings/about/dev/fail)","-- [ ] Step 6 strains view polish (written: src/view/entviews.js), check each arena by screenshot","-- [ ] Step 7 Consult net: src/net/session.js is a STUB, card.js + host/client/codec still to write; harness passes","-- [ ] Step 8 Polish/balance: pars (src/content/ops/pars.js), tests/run.mjs + browser tests, docs/AUTHORING.md, bot skill curve","-- [ ] Step 9 Finish: about.js is a STUB, exit-interview.json, chat reply","+- [x] Step 6 strains and bosses (sim + view), arenas screenshot-checked once","+- [x] Step 7 Consult net: src/net/{session,host,client}.js, src/sim/codec.js, src/stages/card.js. Harness passes 2 players +