{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk7qTNonLNroWx2XBKpj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ecYkGKGSwARBDkXpynowL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef sub(p,a,b=''):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    if a not in s: print('MISS',p,a[:50])\n    open(p,'w').write(s.replace(a,b))\nsub('src/stages/title.js',\"export { UI };\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/title.js',\"import { UI } from '../ui/hud.js';\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"export { PAD, pathAt, DEFAULT_RING_TOOLS, PALETTE };\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"import { glowMaterial, PALETTE, setLookLayer, THREE } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\",\"import { glowMaterial, setLookLayer, THREE } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"import { pathAt } from '../core/geom.js';\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"import { PAD } from '../input/devices.js';\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"const DEFAULT_RING_TOOLS = new Set(['syringe']);\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"        case 'stage': if (ev.retry) this.comm.queue.length = 0; this.hud.setBanner?.call; break;\",\"        case 'stage': if (ev.retry) this.comm.queue.length = 0; break;\")\nsub('src/stages/log.js',\"export { OperationStage, OP_CAMERA };\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/log.js',\"import { OperationStage, OP_CAMERA } from './operation.js';\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/consult.js',\"export { CLOSE_CAM };\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/consult.js',\"import { toTitle, CLOSE_CAM } from './flow.js';\",\"import { toTitle } from './flow.js';\")\nsub('src/sim/strains/introit.js',\"export { pathAt };\\n\")\nsub('src/sim/strains/introit.js',\"import { pathAt } from '../../core/geom.js';\\n\\n\")\nsub('src/app.js',\"export { PALETTE, SLUG };\\n\")\nsub('src/app.js',\"import { loadPack, PALETTE } from '../pixel-engine.js';\",\"import { loadPack } from '../pixel-engine.js';\")\nsub('src/app.js',\"import { SLUG } from './core/meta.js';\\n\")\nsub('src/view/field.js',\"export { POOL_KINDS };\\n\")\nsub('src/view/field.js',\"import { GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, POOL_KINDS, stitchPoint } from '../sim/entities.js';\",\"import { GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, stitchPoint } from '../sim/entities.js';\")\nsub('src/view/field.js',\"const { BufferAttribute, DataTexture,\",\"const { DataTexture,\")\nsub('src/sim/codec.js',\"import { TOOLS } from './entities.js';\\nimport { GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS } from './entities.js';\",\"import { GEL_COLS, GEL_ROWS, TOOLS } from './entities.js';\")\nsub('tests/balance.mjs',\"void readFileSync;\\n\")\nsub('tests/balance.mjs',\"import { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\",\"import { writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\")\nsub('tests/balance.mjs',\"      if (skill === 0) void rankOf;\\n\")\nsub('tests/balance.mjs',\"import { finalTally, rankOf } from '../src/sim/scoring.js';\",\"import { finalTally } from '../src/sim/scoring.js';\")\np='src/content/exit.js'; s=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"  testingFeedback: [\"); b=s.index(\"  aiHub: {\")\ns=s[:a]+\"\"\"  testingFeedback: [\n    'About 24. Sim and bot runs found 6 (Op 4 fragments that never surfaced, a dressing stage the bot could not finish, shared bot memory breaking determinism, the Code Blue and Pile-Up cases). Browser tests found 2 (a model palette crash at boot, menu presses lost at low frame rates). Content lint found 1. Screenshots found the rest, about 15 (a mirrored hand pose, the wheel under the comm strip, unreadable banners, eyes that looked wrong shut).',\n    'Two: Op 4 could not be finished because hidden fragments never surfaced, and the title screen crashed at boot on a bad palette re-bind.',\n    'The whole-game bot runs: every op at several skills on several seeds. They found the stuck stages and made balance measurable. No human has played it, so human difficulty is unmeasured.',\n    'A first Web Audio check that only proved my own test oscillator worked. I replaced it with an analyser tapped on the real output during a voice line.',\n  ],\n  engineFeedback: [\n    'The HUD plus looks: a real pixel picture for almost no code, crisp text at every resolution. The Song and SoundDef data formats made all-code audio pleasant.',\n    \"Yes. buildModel throws when a build re-binds a palette slot the model lacks, which I learned on the title screen. Polling isDown lost short key presses at low frame rates, so menus read wasPressed too. HERO_CLIPS on a custom rig worked first time.\",\n    'The tissue canvas: a per-arena painted base plus a per-frame repaint from sim state on a displaced plane. It is the look of the game and the engine has nothing like it.',\n    'Reading each pad separately with analog triggers: the engine merges pads and has no triggers, so I polled every pad myself and stopped them pressing keys. Software WebGPU at 3 to 6 fps also made browser tests slow to trust.',\n    'none',\n    'A first-party way to read each pad separately with analog triggers, because a controller-first game needs it and everyone otherwise writes it themselves.',\n  ],\n  promptFeedback: [\n    'The plan was specific where it mattered and marked what it had verified, so I could trust numbers like the camera, the look and the build recipe instead of rediscovering them.',\n    \"The plan's verified hand pose had the instrument and the forearm on opposite sides, which took a screenshot to catch. I also had to guess whether GameTitle in the file name means the subtitle too; I included it.\",\n    'Keeping the bosses honest for the bot, the rewind and the network at once, because every strain has to be plain data with many jobs. Judging feel without playing it at real speed was the other.',\n    'I would state a target play length per op measured against a person, not a bot, since a bot cannot say how long a person will take. My first run time is untested against the 80 minutes in the plan.',\n  ],\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nrm -f tests/browser/dbg.mjs tests/browser/console.mjs tests/browser/drive.mjs tests/browser/sessionshot.mjs tests/tmp/probe.mjs\ncat >> docs/AUTHORING.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Building and testing\n\n- `node tools/build.mjs` writes `dist/game.html` (for the tests) and the deliverable one folder up. It needs `esbuild`.\n- `npm install playwright@1.63.0` once, for the browser tests and the kit's `check.mjs`.\n- `node tests/run.mjs [sim|content|browser|hub]` prints only failures and one count line.\n- URL flags outside a session: `?op= &stage= &diff= &seed= &bot= &god= &attract= &dev= &scene=`.\nEOF\nnode tools/exit.mjs; node tools/build.mjs | tail -1; (node tests/run.mjs > tests/tmp/all.log 2>&1; echo finished >> tests/tmp/all.log) &\nwait $!; tail -12 tests/tmp/all.log","description":"Clean up leftovers, finalise feedback, rebuild, run full suite","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4841,"cache_read_input_tokens":686192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4841},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"597d3a1c-db2a-4749-a8fd-5a8ff36f0d78","uuid":"131d602e-9382-44e3-8440-e0eecca89fec","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:45:49.177Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk7qT2U8SbZXr4BQvXvE","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015ecYkGKGSwARBDkXpynowL":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef sub(p,a,b=''):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    if a not in s: print('MISS',p,a[:50])\n    open(p,'w').write(s.replace(a,b))\nsub('src/stages/title.js',\"export { UI };\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/title.js',\"import { UI } from '../ui/hud.js';\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"export { PAD, pathAt, DEFAULT_RING_TOOLS, PALETTE };\\n\")\nsub('src/stages/operation.js',\"import { glowMaterial, PALETTE, setLookLayer, THREE } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\"